comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T17:17:23.656Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: complete all-status searches for exact 10.73.0/8.69.0 and compatible Sentry/TypeScript-ESLint refreshes found closed combined owner pm-7xfndr, latest Sentry owner pm-mwhv33, and earlier tooling owners, but no item owns these newly published versions. npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 remain canonical open deferrals pm-ksr40d and pm-do5b."
  "2026-09-01T17:35:24.383Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: @sentry/node 10.73.0 and typescript-eslint 8.69.0 are locked in the compatible dependency graph. Linked run test-local-mtixwb2z-izr9as passed focused package/Sentry compatibility, exact repo-wide coverage (596 files, 8,262 tests, 60,928/60,928 statements, 46,039/46,039 branches, 12,685/12,685 functions, 58,650/58,650 lines), and packed artifact plus npx/bunx smoke; its first static leg encountered generated tracker/changelog drift while this item was still mutating. After refreshing with pm-changelog 2026.9.1, the complete pnpm quality:static gate passed, both jscpd inventories reported zero clones, and pnpm audit --audit-level low reported no known vulnerabilities. Final pnpm outdated lists only canonical incompatible-major deferrals TypeScript 7 (pm-do5b) and npm-package-arg 14 (pm-ksr40d)."
  "2026-09-01T18:28:30.426Z","harness:codex","Late-review hardening evidence: the DatabaseSync replication set now activates on the setter and restore assignments as well as declarations/loaders. Negative controls cover RuntimeDatabaseSync = databaseSync and RuntimeDatabaseSync = previous. Repo-wide coverage passed 596 files and 8,267 tests at 100/100/100/100; full static gate passed with zero duplicate clones, 100% source/export/member docstrings, and no CodeFactor complexity violations."
  "2026-09-01T18:52:46.612Z","harness:codex","Terminal linked evidence: the tracker-context rerun passed all 4/4 commands: 92 focused package/Sentry tests; full static plus zero-vulnerability audit; 596-file, 8,267-test exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; and packed artifact plus npx/bunx smoke. The earlier schema-context failure is retained as evidence that the defect gate fails closed when tracker evidence is absent."
